WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.142
Peter ate the last carrot.

2
00:00:16.143 --> 00:00:20.634
Then he rubbed his belly.

3
00:00:20.635 --> 00:00:24.461
"I'm still hungry," he said.

4
00:00:24.462 --> 00:00:30.278
"Me too!" said Cotton-tail and Mopsy.

5
00:00:30.279 --> 00:00:38.059
Mrs. Rabbit was in town.

6
00:00:38.060 --> 00:00:43.754
She left some vegetables for her bunnies.

7
00:00:43.755 --> 00:00:48.822
But now the basket was empty.

8
00:00:48.823 --> 00:00:53.189
"Benjamin has a big garden," said Mopsy.

9
00:00:53.190 --> 00:01:06.730
"Let's ask him for some vegetables."

10
00:01:06.731 --> 00:01:16.600
The four bunnies hopped to Benjamin's garden.

11
00:01:16.601 --> 00:01:20.075
"We're hungry," said Mopsy.

12
00:01:20.076 --> 00:01:23.576
"Do you have any vegetables for us?"

13
00:01:23.577 --> 00:01:26.117
Benjamin shook his head.

14
00:01:26.118 --> 00:01:29.168
"I'm sorry," he said.

15
00:01:29.169 --> 00:01:43.157
"I just ate the last pea."

16
00:01:43.158 --> 00:01:55.363
The bunnies hopped home.

17
00:01:55.364 --> 00:01:58.681
"I have an idea," said Peter.

18
00:01:58.682 --> 00:02:02.818
"Let's go to the farmer's trash pile.

19
00:02:02.819 --> 00:02:06.205
There's plenty of food there!"

20
00:02:06.206 --> 00:02:12.359
"Yes!" said Cotton-tail and Mopsy.

21
00:02:12.360 --> 00:02:15.322
Flopsy shook her head.

22
00:02:15.323 --> 00:02:18.961
"Mother will be angry," she said.

23
00:02:18.962 --> 00:02:22.732
"It is not safe.

24
00:02:22.733 --> 00:02:24.703
Father went there.

25
00:02:24.704 --> 00:02:28.530
And he never came home!"

26
00:02:28.531 --> 00:02:33.657
"But we're hungry," said Mopsy and Cotton-tail.

27
00:02:33.658 --> 00:02:45.063
The two bunnies started to cry.

28
00:02:45.064 --> 00:02:51.568
Peter was already hopping toward the door.

29
00:02:51.569 --> 00:02:58.673
"Come on, Flopsy," he said.

30
00:02:58.674 --> 00:03:06.730
"Let's go!"

